    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894090/extras/e425d0aa6ed95703744d63b6e484458a.poster.avif?t=1752927832\" width=600 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894090/extras/e425d0aa6ed95703744d63b6e484458a.webm?t=1752927832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894090/extras/e425d0aa6ed95703744d63b6e484458a.mp4?t=1752927832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim The Living is a zombie horde-survivor roguelike where you play as Dr. J. Ferret, an eccentric scientist who developed a cure capable of turning the infected back to normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cure zombies, lead survivors to safety and rebuild your secret laboratory to grow your arsenal of gadgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Zombie Curing Roguelike</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Reclaim The Living</strong> - Revert zombies back to normal with your wonder cure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your Gadgets</strong> - Create your build by acquiring and customizing your gadget arsenal. Dart Guns, Serum Bombs, Jetpacks, Teleporters &amp; much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop the Cure</strong> - Further customize your wonder cure by making it stronger or giving it viral properties so it spreads amongst the zombie horde.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebuild your Laboratory</strong> - With the help of the survivors and resources you collect, rebuild your secret lab and grow your arsenal of gadgets through permanent meta upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie Virus Mutations</strong> - In this roguelike, you not only get to pick your upgrades but also influence how the zombie virus mutates. You'll need to decide between making zombies more resilient, faster or transform them into mutated zombies with unique mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the World</strong> - Discover multiple levels with unique resources and mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong> - Where did the zombie virus come from... or who caused it?! Uncover the truth through animated comic books spread throughout the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894090/extras/cba08935e854d66205e76120e042f7f1.avif?t=1752927832\" width=201 height=138 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894090/extras/e425d0aa6ed95703744d63b6e484458a.poster.avif?t=1752927832\" width=600 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894090/extras/e425d0aa6ed95703744d63b6e484458a.webm?t=1752927832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894090/extras/e425d0aa6ed95703744d63b6e484458a.mp4?t=1752927832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim The Living is a zombie horde-survivor roguelike where you play as Dr. J. Ferret, an eccentric scientist who developed a cure capable of turning the infected back to normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cure zombies, lead survivors to safety and rebuild your secret laboratory to grow your arsenal of gadgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Zombie Curing Roguelike</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Reclaim The Living</strong> - Revert zombies back to normal with your wonder cure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your Gadgets</strong> - Create your build by acquiring and customizing your gadget arsenal. Dart Guns, Serum Bombs, Jetpacks, Teleporters &amp; much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop the Cure</strong> - Further customize your wonder cure by making it stronger or giving it viral properties so it spreads amongst the zombie horde.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebuild your Laboratory</strong> - With the help of the survivors and resources you collect, rebuild your secret lab and grow your arsenal of gadgets through permanent meta upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie Virus Mutations</strong> - In this roguelike, you not only get to pick your upgrades but also influence how the zombie virus mutates. You'll need to decide between making zombies more resilient, faster or transform them into mutated zombies with unique mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the World</strong> - Discover multiple levels with unique resources and mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong> - Where did the zombie virus come from... or who caused it?! Uncover the truth through animated comic books spread throughout the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894090/extras/cba08935e854d66205e76120e042f7f1.avif?t=1752927832\" width=201 height=138 /></span></p>",
